Package: FederatedLassoStudy
Title: Comparing Federated and Pooled Lasso Prediction Across OMOP Databases
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Egill", "Fridgeirsson", , "e.fridgeirsson@erasmusmc.nl", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Study package for comparing federated, local and pooled
    logistic prediction workflows across five OMOP databases with
    leave-one-database-out external validation. It defines the prediction
    tasks, predictors and method settings, and runs the comparison with a
    pinned release of the FederatedLearning framework.
License: Apache License (>= 2)
Imports:
    FederatedLearning (>= 0.2.0.9000),
    PatientLevelPrediction
